		<Name>
			<Text TI="">Code for compressor OFF</Text>
		</Name>
		<diskreterSW xml:space="preserve">0 ... 17</diskreterSW>
		<analogerSWunten></analogerSWunten>
		<analogerSWoben></analogerSWoben>
		<SWE></SWE>
		<SWF>T</SWF>
		<Meldungstext>\T\Y\F\J\NY\Y\S\J\NZ\L\S\K\N \L\S\G\ANote:\L\S\K\N

0 = Compressor ON
 1-17 = Compressor OFF\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor ON:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Requirement)\L\S\K\A
 0\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOK\L\S\K\I - A/C system switched on, all requirements met;\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor OFF:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Requirement)\L\S\K\A
 1\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOverpressure\L\S\K\I - coolant pressure too high: p \L\S\G\N&gt;\L\S\K\I 32 bar;\L\S\K\A
 2\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IBlower\L\S\K\I - Blower malfunctioning and current voltage &lt; 3 V;\L\S\K\A
 3\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IVacuum\L\S\K\I - Refrigerant pressure too low, thresholds dependent on outside temperature,
 p &lt; 2 bar;\L\S\K\A
 5\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine start\L\S\K\I - Engine running time \L\S\G\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 4 sec (no engine start detected);\L\S\K\A
 6\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IECON\L\S\K\I - ECON-mode;\L\S\K\A
 7\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IA/C system OFF\L\S\K\I - Blower switch in position 0;\L\S\K\A
 8\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOutside temperature\L\S\K\I - Outside temperature too low, outside temperature \L\S\G\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 3.0 °C;\L\S\K\A
 10\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ILow voltage\L\S\K\I - Vehicle voltage supply too low;\L\S\K\A
 11\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine temperature indicator lamp switch-off\L\S\K\I - Engine temperature &gt; 118 °C;\L\S\K\A
 12\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine Control Module (ECM) shut-off\L\S\K\I - Reason e.g. engine temperature, coolant fan control module, Kick-Down;\L\S\K\A
 13\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IExcess voltage\L\S\K\I - Voltage supply too high, V (terminal 15) &gt; 17 V;\L\S\K\A
 14\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvaporator temperature risk of icing\L\S\K\I - Evaporator temperature too low;\L\S\K\A
 15\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\Ino or incorrect vehicle coding\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
 16\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ICompressor activation\L\S\K\I - Malfunction in activation path, e.g. open circuit/short circuit to B+;\L\S\K\A
 17\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IPressure sensor\L\S\K\I - no or implausible signal from pressure sensor (PWM-signal)</Meldungstext>
